{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Design point (c) op-cert key permissions on Windows: governed by the operator's 2026-11-18 decision recorded on cloistered-decomposed-nymph (Windows relies on the default ACL). Apply it as almondy-columned-iguanodon did: skip the 0o600 assertion in test_opcert_producer_seam_8d8e.py::test_key_genesis_permissions_and_gitignore on Windows with a reason citing cloistered-decomposed-nymph, and record the line as intentionally unsupported."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1795455637192162001,"uuid":"e05b8468-75da-4f51-9f04-55dbc39b6405"}